      "writtenOn": "2020-09-16T08:49:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This target is for Linux/ARM64 hosts. We are running cuttefish VM on both x86 and arm hosts. For x86, we are building the host tools like crosvm natively using Android build system, but for arm64, we have been building the tools outside of the Android build system, dropped the built artifacts as prebuilts, and used the prebuilts. This CL is an attempt to build the host (arm64) tools using Android build system.",
